  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : Total number of ways of distributing \\(n\\) objects randomly among \\(n\\) persons \\(=\\mathrm{n}^n\\)\nNumber of ways in which each person gets exactly one object \\(={ }^n P_n=n\\) !\n\\(\\therefore\\) Required number of ways \\(=n^n-n\\) !",
    "image": null
  },
